# Paper ↔ code sync

When drawing or updating anything in Paper.design for this portfolio:

- **Only represent what already exists in code** (Astro pages, MDX frontmatter/body, `src/ds` primitives, tokens).
- **Do not invent** Media frames, placeholders, captions, screenshots, sections, stack tags, metrics, or copy that are not in the source files.
- If code has no `<Media>` (or equivalent), the Paper artboard must not show media boxes.
- Prefer reading the live source (`src/content/projects/*.mdx`, page components, DESIGN.md) before mutating Paper.
- Paper is for reviewing / revising the shipped UI — not for speculative design that the codebase does not yet have.
